  "version": 1,
  "name": "gravitational lens -- double image (plane wave)",
  "description": "Antenna array: a vertical line of in-phase oscillating charges (a current sheet) emits a plane EM wave that focuses behind the GM=2.5 mass into a caustic with interference -- the 2D wave-optics signature of gravitational focusing (Einstein-ring cross-section). Click any element to see/edit its drive (amp, omega, phase, axis) and forces flag.",
